摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Quote selected conversation text into the composer and ask a targeted follow-up — a Web-only DeepSeek Harness plugin, public seams only.","id":"gh:1359378749","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-quote-followup","slug":"tr1v3r/dsh-quote-followup","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Quote selected conversation text into the composer and ask a targeted follow-up — a Web-only DeepSee"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"k Harness plugin, public seams only."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-quote-followup"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Web-only DeepSeek Harness plugin for quoting selected conversation text into the composer and aski"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ng a focused follow-up."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Select. Quote. Follow up."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Select text inside the Web conversation transcript to reveal a floating **Quote** button.\n- Append"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" a native DSH conversation-reference chip without replacing the existing draft, using the session-sc"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"oped composer input facade rather than Lexical's private node registry.\n- Reuse the same atomic `Ref"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"erenceChipNode`, conversation icon, and business color as `@file` / `@session`.\n- Keep each chip com"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"pact by showing only the excerpt; the bubble icon already conveys that it is a quote.\n- Follow the a"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ctive DSH locale for the floating action and serialized quote frame.\n- Attach the conversation turn "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"number to the serialized frame when both ends of the selection belong to the same DSH chat row. Sele"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"ctions spanning messages keep the excerpt but omit ambiguous role/turn provenance.\n- Quote multiple "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"excerpts; on send, the plugin codec expands each chip into a model-readable Markdown blockquote.\n- R"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"esolve the active session through the DSH 0.1.7 UI session adapter, while retaining the older sessio"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"n-list selection path; never paste an unscoped quote when no session binding is available.\n- Fall ba"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ck to a plain-text quote when the host lacks native chip support.\n- Show a localized notice if the c"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"omposer is missing or unavailable, restore the selection, and let you retry quoting the original tex"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"poser is missing or unavailable, restore the selection, and let you retry quoting the original text."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"TUI is intentionally unsupported."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Scope"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"This is a Web client-side extension. The composer and send path are owned by the browser client: chi"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ps exist only in the Lexical editor, and the model only ever sees the Markdown blockquotes the codec"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" expands at send time — never the chips themselves. No host-side plugin surface is involved."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Chips are text-only by design. They carry the excerpt, a display-only role hint, the conversation tu"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"rn ordinal when it is available, and a truncation flag — no global session-message references — so t"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"hey stay valid across compaction folds and session rotation."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Requires DSH `>=0.1.2-rc.1`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Add `dsh-quote-followup` to the Web profile's `dsh.profile.bundles`, then restart `dsh web` so the s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"erver rebuilds its boot-time client bundle. Reload or reopen browser tabs that stayed open across th"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e restart; their already-loaded JavaScript cannot update itself from a new server process."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Select text in a conversation message.\n2. Click **❐ Quote**.\n3. Select and quote more excerpts if"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" needed.\n4. Type the follow-up after the inserted chips and send."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The regression harness covers modern and legacy session selection, absent selection/binding, compact"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" native quote chips, locale switching, single-row versus cross-message provenance, missing/locked co"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"mposer feedback and retry, repeated quoting, spacing after an existing draft, codec serialization, t"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"he Firefox text fallback, and current-client takeover of stale singleton/button state after a hot sw"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"Firefox text fallback, and current-client takeover of stale singleton/button state after a hot swap."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"An opt-in assembled DSH Web regression runs the plugin through a pinned, built DSH checkout with Chr"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"omium. It covers existing drafts, repeated quoting, undo/redo, session isolation, prompt serializati"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"on, and Host-driven unavailable input."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
